<span class="line"><span style="color:#98C379;">        &quot;rejected&quot;</span><span style="color:#ABB2BF;">: </span><span style="color:#98C379;">&quot;Let me think about this. 15 times 7. Well, 10 times 7 is 70, and 5 times 7 is 35, so the answer might be around 105.&quot;</span><span style="color:#ABB2BF;">,</span></span>
